    "opening": "Ceramic coating profit margin depends on the whole package cost, especially inspection, preparation and paid delivery time. Subtract the costs caused by the assignment to find contribution, then compare monthly contribution with overhead and owner compensation. The coating bottle alone does not describe the economics. These fictional USD examples show how to price a defined package and test its workload; they are not local market prices, product instructions or claims about coating performance.",
